DTSTART:20260305T170000Z
DTEND:20260305T200000Z
SUMMARY:Free Food @ Multicultural Center: Pancakes and Pajamas
DESCRIPTION:We're inviting students to wear their coziest pajamas and stop by the MCC for a light breakfast bar featuring pancakes, waffles, fruit, coffee and more. The goal is to promote comfort, self-care, and de-stressing during midterms.
LOCATION:Multicultural Center
END:VEVENT
